{"type":"message","id":"92e4f844","parentId":"b96e991a","timestamp":"2026-05-18T11:33:31.736Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_oHR1EbSCG562bW73AtGEbX1i","toolName":"process","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[INFO]  Starting image generation for prompt: Focused male trader at multi-screen trading desk, Bitcoin price chart visible on...\n[INFO]  Generation attempt 1 of 3...\n[INFO]  API response status: 200\n[INFO]  Generation submitted. ID: 93e5b120-7aca-4250-a778-5b87a3079ef4\n[INFO]  Polling for generation completion (max 6 polls x 10s = 60s)...\n[INFO]  Poll 1 of 6...\n[INFO]  Image ready! URL: https://cdn.leonardo.ai/users/4e6cdfb9-e008-469b-9c7c-35a85ae2b9cb/generations/9...\n[INFO]  Downloading image to /tmp/crypto-feature.jpg...\n[ERROR] Downloaded file is too small (43 bytes). Likely a corrupted or error response image.\n\nProcess exited with code 1."}],"details":{"status":"failed","sessionId":"nova-coral","exitCode":1,"aggregated":"[INFO]  Starting image generation for prompt: Focused male trader at multi-screen trading desk, Bitcoin price chart visible on...\n[INFO]  Generation attempt 1 of 3...\n[INFO]  API response status: 200\n[INFO]  Generation submitted. ID: 93e5b120-7aca-4250-a778-5b87a3079ef4\n[INFO]  Polling for generation completion (max 6 polls x 10s = 60s)...\n[INFO]  Poll 1 of 6...\n[INFO]  Image ready! URL: https://cdn.leonardo.ai/users/4e6cdfb9-e008-469b-9c7c-35a85ae2b9cb/generations/9...\n[INFO]  Downloading image to /tmp/crypto-feature.jpg...\n[ERROR] Downloaded file is too small (43 bytes). Likely a corrupted or error response image.\n","name":"bash /home/bhard/.openclaw/...rate-image/generate.sh"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779104011735}}
{"type":"message","id":"7558014e","parentId":"92e4f844","timestamp":"2026-05-18T11:33:34.971Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_sRuZFnQJj9jLtoFZehhsXXoS","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-creator/skills/generate-image/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gpt-5.4-mini","usage":{"input":631,"output":258,"cacheRead":9856,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":10745,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779104011736,"responseId":"chatcmpl-DgqVzdESyE0jPyDtUJcqW8KtTjCGw"}}
{"type":"message","id":"f92c81d6","parentId":"7558014e","timestamp":"2026-05-18T11:33:35.001Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_sRuZFnQJj9jLtoFZehhsXXoS","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Skill: generate-image\n\n## What This Skill Does\nGenerates a photorealistic editorial feature image using the Leonardo AI API, downloads it locally, and optionally watermarks it with the brand logo.\n\n## How to Invoke\n\n```bash\nbash ~/.openclaw/workspace-creator/skills/generate-image/generate.sh \"<YOUR PROMPT>\"\n```\n\n**Example:**\n```bash\nbash ~/.openclaw/workspace-creator/skills/generate-image/generate.sh \"Focused male trader at multi-screen trading desk, Bitcoin price chart visible on monitor, dark professional office, editorial press photography, Reuters style, photorealistic, DSLR, 35mm lens, sharp focus, candid\"\n```\n\n## Return Values\n\n| Exit Code | Meaning | Where to Read Result |\n|-----------|---------|----------------------|\n| `0` (success) | Image generated and saved | `cat /tmp/image-result.txt` → will print `/tmp/crypto-feature.jpg` |\n| `1` (failure) | Something went wrong | `cat /tmp/image-error.log` → will print the exact failure reason |\n\n## What the Script Handles Automatically\n- ✅ Submitting to Leonardo AI API with your credentials\n- ✅ Error classification: fatal errors (bad key, bad prompt) vs transient errors (network, 5xx)\n- ✅ Exponential backoff retry on transient failures (up to 3 attempts: 5s → 10s → 20s waits)\n- ✅ Polling for up to 60 seconds (6 polls × 10s) until the image is ready\n- ✅ Downloading the image to `/tmp/crypto-feature.jpg`\n- ✅ Validating the file is a real JPEG larger than 50KB\n- ✅ Stamping the logo watermark (non-fatal — continues even if logo is missing)\n\n## What YOU Must Do (Your Only Job)\n1. Read the article title and topic from the message you received.\n2. Craft a high-quality editorial image prompt using the rules in your SOUL.md.\n3. Call this script with that prompt.\n4. Read the result:\n   - If exit code 0: Return `cat /tmp/image-result.txt`\n   - If exit code 1: Return `IMAGE_FAILED: ` + `cat /tmp/image-error.log`\n\n## Important Notes\n- The prompt must be under 1000 characters.\n- Do NOT include any text, logos, or written words in your prompt description.\n- The image will always be saved to `/tmp/crypto-feature.jpg` (1024×576 resolution).\n- Do NOT call the Leonardo API directly — always use this script.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779104015001}}
